Cell["\<\
Playfair's axiom on the grid: through a vertex of the third row there is \
exactly one parallel to the first row, and it is the row.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"12458625-c87e-4486-b0d3-02e5c08a758d"],

